  "event_seq": 103,
  "root_problem": "Billing dispute ticket volume roughly doubled from ~600/month in Jun-Jul to 1180-1260/month in Aug-Sep 2026 (F-03), and disputed bills split almost evenly between ACTUAL (1785) and ESTIMATED (1240) read types rather than concentrating on estimate-substituted accounts (F-05). This pattern, together with the absence of any tariff change (F-04) and Customer Service meeting its response SLA (F-01), best fits a change to billing import validation rules (e.g. estimate-substitution logic) around August 2026 that produces systematic wrong bills across both read types, driving the dispute surge."
